# Icon actions in UI

For table row actions and compact toolbar actions in the web UI:

- Prefer **icon-only** buttons (edit, delete, view, open external, toggle, etc.).
- Do **not** use full text labels like "Edit", "Hapus", "Nonaktifkan" on action cells.
- Always set `title` and `aria-label` (Indonesian) so the action stays accessible.
- Use shared helpers in `web/src/icons.tsx` / `IconButton` from `web/src/ui.tsx`.
- Destructive actions: icon in danger color + confirm dialog still OK.
- Primary form submit buttons (Buat, Simpan) may keep text labels.
- External links in action rows (admin/client portal) also use icons, not words.

# Sensitive inputs

- Every password / secret field must use `SecretInput` from `web/src/ui.tsx` (built-in show/hide eye toggle).
- Do **not** use raw `<input type="password">` in new UI.
- Keep `autoComplete` appropriate (`current-password` / `new-password`).
